{"id":"n63183-1-7","stage":5,"title":"생소하다 · 陌生","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63183-1-7-1","ko":"길이 생소한데? 우리가 잘못 찾아왔나 봐.","zh":"这条路好生陌生啊？看来我们找错地方了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"길이","meaning":"路，路途","explanation":"길：路，路途；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"3","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길이","audio":"/audio/75aba55303fbffdfc7bf.mp3"}},{"text":"생소한데?","meaning":"陌生","explanation":"생소하다：陌生；ㄴ데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"생소하다","audio":"/audio/4a92735eb37d18ee7a55.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63183","senseId":"1","lemma":"생소하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생소한데","audio":"/audio/92830f63836858419d0f.mp3"}},{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"잘못","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"잘못：错，错误。","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62477","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아왔나","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아왔나","audio":"/audio/7c401e5ad245dff6ad67.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"4","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，路途","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"为了到达一定目的地而经过的空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"4a92735eb37d18ee","term":"생소하다","zh":"陌生","audio":"/audio/4a92735eb37d18ee7a55.mp3","entryId":"63183","definition":"对某个对象不熟悉而生疏。","pronunciation":["생소하다"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62477","definition":"做不好或做错的事。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"来找，来访，访问","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"来见某人或做某事。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ced411828061e807720f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63183-1-7-2","ko":"아니야. 지름길로 잘 찾아왔어.","zh":"不对哦，我们是走捷径才找到这里的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니야.","meaning":"不是，不对","explanation":"아니야：不是，不对。","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29726","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니야","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}},{"text":"지름길로","meaning":"捷径，近路","explanation":"지름길：捷径，近路；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"지름길","audio":"/audio/4ce94d85193c2c9c52ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27799","senseId":"1","lemma":"지름길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지름길로","audio":"/audio/016edbc4121f888e6505.